@startuml

title Source-Grounded Analysis and Hallucination Control

actor "System Analyst" as ANALYST

rectangle "Source Artefacts" as SOURCE

rectangle "Evidence Extraction" as EXTRACTION

rectangle "Evidence Classification" as CLASSIFICATION

rectangle "FACT" as FACT
rectangle "INFERENCE" as INFERENCE
rectangle "UNKNOWN" as UNKNOWN

rectangle "Validation" as VALIDATION

rectangle "Structured Result" as RESULT

ANALYST --> SOURCE : Analysis request

SOURCE --> EXTRACTION : Available evidence

EXTRACTION --> CLASSIFICATION : Extracted information

CLASSIFICATION --> FACT : Explicitly supported

CLASSIFICATION --> INFERENCE : Reasonable conclusion

CLASSIFICATION --> UNKNOWN : Evidence unavailable

FACT --> VALIDATION
INFERENCE --> VALIDATION
UNKNOWN --> VALIDATION

VALIDATION --> RESULT : Approved result

note right of FACT
  Directly supported
  by source artefacts.
end note

note right of INFERENCE
  Analytical conclusion.
  Must not be presented
  as source-backed fact.
end note

note right of UNKNOWN
  Information cannot be
  established from available
  evidence.

  Do not invent.
end note

note bottom of VALIDATION
  UNKNOWN must never be
  silently converted into FACT.
end note

@enduml
